Implemented:

- NBT path parser/matcher/mutator with six vanilla node types and tests in [nbt_path.rs](/home/eshanki/pumpkin-wt/nbt-data-command/crates/pumpkin/src/command/argument_types/nbt_path.rs:1).
- Migrated `/data` to the newer framework with entity/block `get`, `merge`, and `remove` in [data.rs](/home/eshanki/pumpkin-wt/nbt-data-command/crates/pumpkin/src/command/commands/data.rs:1).
